  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nThe given expression = 18 - [6 - {13 - (78 - 8 ÷ 2 × 5 of 3)}]\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n18 - [6 - {13 - (78 - 8 ÷ 2 × 5 of 3)}]\n\n= 18 - [6 - {13 - (78 - 8 ÷ 2 × 5 × 3)}]\n\n= 18 - [6 - {13 - (78 - 4 × 15)}]\n\n= 18 - [6 - {13 - (78 - 60)}]\n\n= 18 - [6 - {13 - 18}]\n\n= 18 - [6 - {- 5}]\n\n= 18 - [6 + 5]\n\n= 18 - 11\n\n= 7\n\n**∴ The value of the given expression is 7**",
